{"page":514,"verses":[{"verse_key":"48:24","surah":48,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِى كَفَّ أَيْدِيَهُمْ عَنكُمْ وَأَيْدِيَكُمْ عَنْهُم بِبَطْنِ مَكَّةَ مِنۢ بَعْدِ أَنْ أَظْفَرَكُمْ عَلَيْهِمْ ۚ وَكَانَ ٱللَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ بَصِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"In the valley of Mecca it was He who held their hands back from you and your hands back from them after He gave you the advantage over them––God sees all that you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"48:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"48:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَفَّ","en_gloss":"withheld","transliteration":"kaffa","verse_key":"48:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَيْدِيَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their hands","transliteration":"aydiyahum","verse_key":"48:24"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَنكُمْ","en_gloss":"from you","transliteration":"ʿankum","verse_key":"48:24"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَأَيْدِيَكُمْ","en_gloss":"and your hands","transliteration":"wa-aydiyakum","verse_key":"48:24"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَنْهُم","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"48:24"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِبَطْنِ","en_gloss":"within","transliteration":"bibaṭni","verse_key":"48:24"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَكَّةَ","en_gloss":"Makkah","transliteration":"makkata","verse_key":"48:24"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"48:24"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"48:24"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَنْ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"48:24"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَظْفَرَكُمْ","en_gloss":"He gave you victory","transliteration":"aẓfarakum","verse_key":"48:24"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"over them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"48:24"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَكَانَ","en_gloss":"And is","transliteration":"wakāna","verse_key":"48:24"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"48:24"},{"pos"